[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-oxford-ellison-scholarship-program-2026-uk-fully-funded-opportunity-194":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},194,"university-of-oxford-ellison-scholarship-program-2026-uk-fully-funded-opportunity-194","University Of Oxford Ellison Scholarship Program 2026 Uk: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>Ellison Institute of Technology, alongside the University of Oxford, is offering the Ellison Scholarship Program 2026 to intending undergraduate students from all over the world.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr \u002F>\u003Cstrong>University of Oxford Ellison Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Oxford | Ellison Institute of Technology\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom (UK)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Educationopportunity blog\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: July 31st, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Oxford Ellison Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>An academic scholarship that funds all course fees at the University of Oxford, with a generous stipend to cover things such as travel, programming, accommodation and living expenses. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The multi-year programme includes the equivalent of paid internships, with continued work on a project within EIT’s humane endeavours.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Join a team with other Scholars and the EIT Faculty of Fellows to work on important projects during the academic year and summers.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholars will have ongoing access to EIT technology and human assets as they continue working toward profound change in their home country and around the world.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Ellison Undergraduate Scholars Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate Ellison Undergraduate Scholars Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Scholarshipdatabase access\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The Ellison Scholars programme is looking for candidates from around the world  each year, who are passionate about solving humanity’s most serious problems.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholars will fully commit to both their study at the University of Oxford and their ongoing project work with EIT. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants will need to meet the University of Oxford’s entry requirements for their chosen course. Applicants must:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have met, or be on track to meet, the University’s \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ox.ac.uk\u002Fadmissions\u002Fundergraduate\u002Fapplying-to-oxford\u002Ffor-international-students\u002FELR\">\u003Cstrong>English Language requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong> \u003C\u002Fstrong>for their chosen undergraduate degree\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have, or be on track to have, a secondary education\u002Fhigh school leaving qualification, diploma or certificate accepted by the \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ox.ac.uk\u002Fadmissions\u002Fundergraduate\u002Fapplying-to-oxford\u002Ffor-international-students\u002Finternational-qualifications\">\u003Cstrong>University of Oxford\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have met, or be on track to meet, the \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ox.ac.uk\u002Fadmissions\u002Fundergraduate\u002Fcourses\u002Fcourse-listing\">\u003Cstrong>entry requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa> for their chosen undergraduate degree (including minimum grade requirements)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Oxford Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Oxford Ellison Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ensure to read the details we have provided on this webpage diligently\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship application website\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the APPLY NOW button for Ellison Scholars\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>In your application, you will need to prove you meet the \u003Cstrong>eligibility requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong> and describe how you meet the \u003Cstrong>selection criteria\u003C\u002Fstrong> for the Ellison Scholars programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Apply here:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Feit.org\u002Feducation-and-scholarships\u002Fundergraduate\">https:\u002F\u002Feit.org\u002Feducation-and-scholarships\u002Fundergraduate\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-30 16:59:17",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-oxford-ellison-scholarship-program-2026-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69f37c55437fe4.52687980_screenshot 2026-04-30 164811.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-oxford-ellison-scholarship-program-2026-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69f37c55437fe4.52687980_screenshot%202026-04-30%20164811.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":4